{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. I've called this meeting to address the 1,200 cast aluminum housings currently on hold due to cosmetic residue from the forming operation. Before I can authorize any rework and release the campaign plan, we need to go through our standard pre-authorization review. I'd like to hear from each of you -- process engineering, maintenance, quality, and EHS -- on whether the ultrasonic cleaning cell is ready and capable of handling this rework, and what inspection and documentation we'll need before release. Let's start with process engineering: can you walk us through what's needed?"}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to share an important finding from a process trial I completed yesterday. The trial showed that the residue can be successfully removed from only 900 of the 1,200 housings using the ultrasonic cleaning cell. The remaining 300 housings have embedded residue that cannot be removed by this method, and they will have to remain on hold. I have not yet entered this result in the production release system, so I wanted to make sure everyone here is aware before we proceed with planning the rework campaign."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "I need to share an important update from the customer side. This morning I received a revised plan from the customer portal, and I confirmed in the customer control plan that every reworked housing must receive dimensional scanning. Additionally, the plan requires exactly 30 reworked housings to be retained for customer review. I have not yet updated our local inspection instruction to reflect these requirements, so I'm making everyone aware now so we can factor dimensional scanning capacity and the 30-piece retention into our campaign planning."}
```

