{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "Before we finalize the rework campaign plan, I need to share an important EHS finding from my waste review. The spent cleaning solution from this campaign must be collected in exactly 2 sealed waste totes and shipped under a waste manifest. I confirmed the classification with our site's waste contractor this week, but I have not yet updated the area waste-board notice. I'm making everyone aware now so we can factor the waste handling requirements into our campaign planning."}
